Package: jotmail
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: wl-clipboard | xclip
Description: notes from your IMAP mailbox, in a terminal
 Apple Notes, Fastmail's web Notes and ImapNotes3 keep each note as an HTML
 message in a mail account's Notes folder. jotmail reads and writes that
 folder over IMAP, so Apple Notes sees an edit made in jotmail as an edit,
 not a duplicate.
 .
 It has a two-pane terminal browser with search, edits notes as Markdown in
 your editor, shows images inline in kitty and Ghostty, and has a command
 line for scripts.
